<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Union and intersection</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>\(A = {@dset(A)@}\) and \(B = {@Bd@}\).</p><p>(a) List the elements of \(A \cup B\).</p><p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p><p>(b) List the elements of \(A \cap B\).</p><p>[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p><p>(c) Find \(n(A \cup B)\).</p><p>[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</p>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>First list \(B\): \(B = {@dset(B)@}\).</p><p>(a) \(A \cup B\) holds the elements in \(A\) or \(B\) or both, each written once: \(A \cup B = {@dset(U)@}\).</p><p>(b) \(A \cap B\) holds the elements in both sets: \(A \cap B = {@dset(I)@}\).</p><p>(c) \(n(A \cup B) = {@nU@}\). Check: \(n(A) + n(B) - n(A \cap B) = {@dbl@} - {@nI@} = {@nU@}\).</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>3</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
